$('autoplay').onclick=()=>{auto=stock>0&&!auto;if(auto)fire();status()};$('sound').onclick=()=>{sound=!sound;if(sound){ac??=new AudioContext();ac.resume();tone(660,.12)}$('sound').querySelector('span').textContent='사운드 '+(sound?'ON':'OFF')};$('help').onclick=()=>{held=auto=false;status();$('guide').showModal()};$('close').onclick=()=>$('guide').close();$('refill').onclick=()=>{stock=500;msg('구슬 500개가 충전되었습니다.');status()};document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden){held=auto=false;status()}});
